  "summary": "MSA 按 GQA group 选择历史块；主分支仍是精确 softmax attention，不是旧 MiniMax 的线性注意力。",
  "pattern": "3 × GQA/Dense → 57 × MSA/MoE",
  "tiny_status": "未找到精确 M3 tiny",
  "tiny_note": "Collection 中有 MiniMax H3、M3.1-Flash 等，但本次未找到精确 M3 tiny。不替换型号；本页只展示官方 M3 基模。",
  "highlights": [
    "每个GQA group独立选择16个128-token块",
    "128专家选4 +1 shared；路由权重和为2.0",
    "SwiGLU-OAI激活；标准残差与Gemma-style norm"
  ],
  "input": "文本embedding；CLIP-style ViT32层/H1280/patch14、3D RoPE，spatial merge2、temporal2 → projector到H6144，按图像／视频占位拼接。",
  "norm": "层norm与Q/K per-head norm使用Gemma风格RMSNorm(1+w)。attention_output_gate=false。",
  "position": "RoPE theta5,000,000，每head128中仅64维旋转。索引分支与主attention的具体后端数据布局见实现来源。",
  "residual": {
    "title": "普通单路 residual",
    "summary": "attention与Dense/MoE各走一次pre-norm residual。",
    "steps": [
      "Gemma-style pre-RMSNorm",
