      "title": "MiniMax Sparse Attention · per-group block selection",
      "summary": "每个GQA group选择总计16个128-token块；local block先强制高分，再包含在16个top-k预算中。",
      "steps": [
        "main Q/K/V + index Q/K projection",
        "Q/K norm + partial RoPE",
        "append main and index-key caches",
        "per-group block score=max",
        "top16 blocks（包含强制保留的local block）",
        "exact causal attention on selected blocks",
        "O projection"
      ],
      "equations": [
        "GQA groups=4; Qheads=64; KVheads=4",
